HB0074 County clerks-frivolous filings procedure.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Larsen, L and Lawley and Senator(s)
Barlow and Nethercott
AN ACT relating to county clerks; authorizing county clerks to seek to have
frivolous filings rejected or notated as frivolous; specifying requirements and
procedures for rejecting or notating frivolous filings; and providing for an
effective date.
